{"id":"8335a662839d3ab3","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-subdirectly-irred.md","title":"Subdirectly Irreducible","display":"Subdirectly Irreducible","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-subdirectly-irred","aliases":["93-cor-subdirectly-irred"],"display":"Subdirectly Irreducible","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","[[93-prop-birkhoff-subdirectly-irred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-subdirectly-irred"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-subdirectly-irred</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Subdirectly Irreducible"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d50db03d116b595\" href=\"?note=0d50db03d116b595\" title=\"93-prop-birkhoff-subdirectly-irred\">93-prop-birkhoff-subdirectly-irred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-subdirectly-irred---Subdirectly-Irreducible\">cor-subdirectly-irred - Subdirectly Irreducible</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is its diagonal congruence, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu\\ne\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\land\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(\\theta\\ne\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\to\\mu\\subseteq\\theta)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu\\ne\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\land\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(\\theta\\ne\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\to\\mu\\subseteq\\theta)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the congruence-lattice characterization of subdirect irreducibility.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-subdirectly-irred---Subdirectly-Irreducible","text":"cor-subdirectly-irred - Subdirectly Irreducible","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-prop-birkhoff-subdirectly-irred","status":"resolved","id":"0d50db03d116b595","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-prop-birkhoff-subdirectly-irred]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)$, $\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}$ is its diagonal congruence, and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is defined in [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu\\ne\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\land\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(\\theta\\ne\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\to\\mu\\subseteq\\theta)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1009,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","135c0cfcbae1f3c5","130ab752f509ade2","0d50db03d116b595"]}